{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-66",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Inspect the full original pre-fold retained sheet after equal square corner cuts, with whole-sheet dimensions 48 cm by 30 cm. Preserve all four notches and twelve outline vertices; do not add a solved cut-side value, interior fold rectangle, base dimensions, or a three-dimensional box.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/figures/fig-66.png",
      "sha256": "51902e92c336001071966c445d92b634636a4a97767dd10b4cc7831e04c2c8e7"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-ex",
        "exercise": "1037",
        "text": "1037.\na) 一个盒子（没有盖）具有长方体形状，它的底是正方形。盒子的底面积比它的侧壁表面积大 $176\\mathrm{cm}^2$。盒子的高度等于 $10\\mathrm{cm}$。求盒子的底面积。\nb) 要用一块尺寸为 $30\\mathrm{cm}$ 和 $48\\mathrm{cm}$ 的长方形白铁皮做一个没有盖的盒子。为此在长方形白铁皮的每个角上剪去一个正方形，再把余下的部分折弯（图 $66$）。为了使盒子的底面积等于它的侧表面的面积，试确定被剪下的正方形的边长。"
      }
    ],
